#HTML^<p>Velnor's Lair is a ROM-loaded Sinclair BASIC program with no
machine-code support layer. This page is a <code>LIST</code> of the
tokenised program in the post-load snapshot (819 lines), from
<code>PROG</code> at #R$5CCB up to <code>VARS</code> at #R$F09D.</p>
<p>The command loop at line 113 reads <code>WHAT WILL YOU DO NOW ?</code>.
Movement updates BASIC variable <code>Z</code> (the location's own line
number) and line 530 <code>GO SUB Z</code> prints the room. Location text
lives in the high line numbers (7000s&amp;ndash;9900s).</p>
<pre class="basic" style="white-space:pre; overflow:auto; font-size:12px; line-height:1.35">
